    "type": "show",
    "description": "Lists local and remote-tracking branches.\n\n**Example:** `git branch -a`\n\n**Pitfalls:**\n- Remote names are pointers; they are not local branches.\n- Stale remotes remain until `git fetch --prune`.\n\n**Why?** find branches on the server without switching",
